	(text "Speaker amplifier - Maxim MAX98357A (LCSC C910544), I2S in, class-D BTL out to J8 (4-8 ohm speaker, no output filter\nneeded for short leads). VDD = VSYS (3.0-4.2 V). GAIN_SLOT open = 9 dB. SD_MODE <- ESP32 GPIO47 (AMP_SD): high = on,\nleft channel; R87 100k keeps the amp off while the ESP32 boots. C95 100 nF + C96 10 uF at VDD.\nRoute OUTP/OUTN as a pair, away from the mic, the ADC sense lines and the compass."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 167.64 203.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "bc27bc3b-03f5-4295-bfd0-e4a38a2101ec")
	)
